      },
      "text": "Deposition adds material to the wafer with atomic-level control. Every film —\ngate oxide, gate metal, barrier layer, dielectric, copper seed — is deposited\nby one of three fundamental mechanisms: chemical vapor deposition (CVD),\natomic layer deposition (ALD), or physical vapor deposition (PVD)."
    },
